  <data key="d0">Two Thunderbolt 4 (USB-C) Ports</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Two Thunderbolt 4 USB-C ports on the MacBook Air that support charging, DisplayPort, Thunderbolt 4 up to 40 Gb/s, and USB 4 up to 40 Gb/s.</data>
  <data key="d3">726b0cc7-6290-41c6-aa12-e0d03faa2bfe:chunk_000001-chunk-000</data>
