<node id="TP-A56R-REG-04 Rev B">
  <data key="d0">TP-A56R-REG-04 Rev B</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">TP-A56R-REG-04 Rev B is the customer master plan referencing the supplier plan for Samsung Orion-R certification support.&lt;SEP&gt;A regulatory qualification and certification test plan with open status and DVT1 execution baseline.&lt;SEP&gt;The master test-plan controlling subordinate plans, sample allocation, configuration lock, witness requirements, and retest disposition.&lt;SEP&gt;A master regulatory qualification plan that controls the DVT1 certification workstreams.</data>
  <data key="d3">312a4b23-48ad-497c-82f3-b58e76e6301e:chunk_000001-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;9e39f966-6a7f-4eaf-b4a1-91379f76dc4d:chunk_000001-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;9e39f966-6a7f-4eaf-b4a1-91379f76dc4d:chunk_000001-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;9e39f966-6a7f-4eaf-b4a1-91379f76dc4d:chunk_000001-chunk-003</data>
